# Architecture boundaries

- UI: presentation and interaction — no business rules hidden only in components
- API: transport, validation, mapping — no core domain logic only in handlers
- Domain: business rules — no framework imports where avoidable
- Infra: I/O, config, external systems

New code must live in the correct layer. Cross-layer fixes need justification.

Depth (Clean Architecture ↔ folders): `portfolio/docs/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md` § Clean Architecture; cases: `portfolio/docs/CLEAN_ARCHITECTURE_CASES.md` — Entities / Use Cases / Interface Adapters / Frameworks; dependencies point inward. Do not conflate Frontend guide “Application” (hooks/client state) with Use Cases.
